From freebsd-alpha  Fri Feb 05 04:42:54 1999
From: Jason Thorpe <thorpej () nas ! nasa ! gov>
Date: Fri, 05 Feb 1999 04:42:54 +0000
To: freebsd-alpha
Subject: Re: alpha PC
